## Package model

The child is the executable package, not a separate physical repository. It must carry its own:
- machine manifest;
- engine/decision interface;
- skill instructions;
- bounded tools;
- API and MCP contracts;
- evals and negative cases;
- validator;
- dedicated workflow template;
- federation contract;
- commercialization candidate manifest;
- rollback/reopen rules.

A standalone repository may be produced later as an optional distribution projection. It is never required merely to establish that the framework package exists.

## Federation

Federation mutation uses GitHub Actions OIDC only from trusted non-PR runtime jobs. Pull-request validation must have no `id-token: write` authority. Exact workflow/ref/environment → agent/capability binding remains required before material runtime mutation.

Before parent certification/governed acceptance:
- no public/production operational claim;
- no provider/customer write;
- no `sync_agents`;
- no self-certification;
- no sovereign vote;
- no MCP/API promotion beyond explicitly enabled D0 surfaces.

## Evidence and IP

Never fabricate current state from documentation, package names or planned manifests. UNKNOWN remains explicit.

Do not commit production credentials, private keys, customer/partner data, restricted evidence bodies, proprietary calibration/weights, private evaluation corpora, protected economic/policy rules or exploit-enabling security internals.

Public-safe dimensions, interfaces, thresholds, schemas and digests may be committed only when the parent IP gate permits that projection. Protected logic must remain in Vault/private runtime and be invoked through governed API/MCP/federation paths.

## GitHub self-sustain

The package may validate itself, run scheduled health/heartbeat lanes, surface drift issues and accept dependency-update proposals. It may not repair `main` directly, auto-merge, manufacture approvals, weaken validators, enable provider/customer writes from CI or grant itself more authority.

## Commercial boundary

Candidate package/service/training/conformance surfaces may be prepared. Exact prices, Stripe Products/Prices, checkout, license grants, certification status and customer entitlements require separate authority.

